# Path: docs/sys/aetherpod.mmd
# Purpose: Mermaid flowchart for AetherPod architecture.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CLI["aetherpod (CLI)"] -->|--data path| DM[DataManager]
    CLI -->|tui| APP[AetherPod App]

    subgraph TUI [Textual TUI]
        APP -->|push| SPLASH[SplashScreen]
        SPLASH -->|dismiss| FEED[FeedScreen]
        FEED -->|Enter| EP[EpisodeScreen]
        EP -->|d| DETAIL[EpisodeDetailScreen]
        EP -->|/| SEARCH[SearchScreen]
        EP -->|N| NOW[NowPlayingScreen]
        EP -->|v| QUEUE[QueueScreen]
        EP -->|?| HELP[HelpScreen]
        APP -->|1s poll| EP
        APP -->|1s poll| NOW
    end

    subgraph PLAYER [Player]
        P[Player] -->|delegates to| ENG[AudioEngine]

        ENG --> MPV[MpvEngine]
        ENG --> VLC[VlcEngine]
        ENG --> FF[FfplayEngine]

        MPV -->|subprocess| MPV_BIN[mpv]
        MPV -->|Unix socket IPC| CTL[Play/Pause/Seek/Speed]
        MPV -->|stdout| PROG[Live Progress]

        VLC -->|subprocess| VLC_BIN[VLC]
        VLC -->|TCP RC port| VCTL[Play/Pause/Seek/Speed]

        FF -->|subprocess| FF_BIN[ffplay]
        FF -->|stdin| FCTL[Pause only]

        MPV_BIN & VLC_BIN & FF_BIN -.->|OS PATH| DETECT[detect_engine]
        P -->|set_eq_preset| EQ[eq.json / EQ presets]
        P -->|callback| DM
        P -.->|downloads| CACHE[(~/.cache/aetherpod)]
    end

    subgraph DATA [Persistence]
        DM --> STATE[(~/.local/state/aetherpod/state.json)]
        DM --> LOG[(~/.local/state/aetherpod/log/aetherpod.log)]
    end

    subgraph NET [Network]
        FETCH[fetch_feed_async] -->|aiohttp| RSS[RSS/Atom Feeds]
        FETCH --> DM
    end

    FEED --> FETCH
    APP --> PLAYER
    EP --> PLAYER
```
